The Purohita of हिरण्यकशिपु. Father of शण्ड and Marka, tutors of प्रह्लाद. Took part in प्रह्लाद's coronation. A ब्रह्मऋषि: Heard of the in- sult offered to his daughter by शर्मिष्ठा, the daughter of the ruler वृषपर्वन् and left the capital. The Purohita of वृषपर्वन्, the latter made him stay offering to make his daughter a slave of देवयाणी. In offering the latter to ययाति, he asked him not to share his bed with शर्मिष्ठा, cursed ययाति to become aged for having shared his bed with शर्मिष्ठा, and on an appeal mitigated it by saying that he could exchange his old age with youth of another if he found one to accept the exchange;
